<tab><cl=F0F010>TOURNAMENTS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>
You can register for the group <l="hts:\\language\tournament.hts">tournament <\l>.
Please note that if the teams are not equal, then you may be transferred to another team at the beginning of the tournament.
In the registration window, your name has the color of the team you joined,
and the rest of the data has the color of the team you will eventually get into,
unless someone else joins in.
}